<p class="note"><b>Success should require reasoning:</b> prediction before animation, a measurement or calculation, then one explanation using the result. Include a restart, keyboard controls, readable labels, a reduced-motion option, and a text alternative. Completing a click should not be presented as evidence of mastery.</p>

