<h2>7. Useful published examples and interactives</h2>
<p>Use these as teacher models or focused student links. Adapt the method to your lesson's notation and difficulty; do not assign an entire chapter merely to fill one missing step.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://openstax.org/books/physics/pages/13-2-wave-properties-speed-amplitude-frequency-and-period">OpenStax Physics 13.2: wave properties</a>: worked examples connecting period, frequency, wavelength, and speed. Best fit for U5L1 graph-to-equation preparation.</li>
